{"year":"2026","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 41st edition took place on February 15, 2026, at the Hollywood Palladium in Los Angeles, hosted by <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1726786, 'screen_type': person}\">Ego Nwodim</a> and streamed on Film Independent's and IMDb's YouTube channels. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1241983, 'screen_type': movie}\">Train Dreams</a> (2025) won three awards: feature, director for <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1590194, 'screen_type': person}\">Clint Bentley</a> and cinematography. The Brazilian film <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1220564, 'screen_type': movie}\">The Secret Agent</a> (2025), by <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1016214, 'screen_type': person}\">Kleber Mendonça Filho</a>, was named best international film. <i>Television awards are not included.</i>"},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Picture","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":1241983,"name":"Sonhos de Trem","image_path":"/iF1SxvdSNWkEfKlZnLzJbSsg4oT.jpg","director":"Clint Bentley","winner":true,"backdrop_path":"/u5NWHVhZ6HWc1fXnqn82cMar5St.jpg"},{"type":"movie","id":1159539,"name":"Peter Hujar's Day","image_path":"/qgpQ6iYVoR96SqrmYf0xHgMZOqp.jpg","director":"Ira Sachs","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":1370814,"name":"The Plague","image_path":"/6JVYncJgP85QjDVwtlPoUhd42fB.jpg","director":"Charlie Polinger","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":1205515,"name":"Sorry, Baby","image_path":"/nJACkQK8bZaRlwkK9jtAH9mqZp4.jpg","director":"Eva Victor","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":1245347,"name":"Twinless","image_path":"/2DDiHWvCRwCWXUjv1xdMefzsrCh.jpg","director":"James Sweeney","winner":false}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Director","nominee_list":[{"type":"person","id":1590194,"name":"Clint Bentley","image_path":"/fP89nBimnLvUcWhIBPJfgkqVRsf.jpg","winner":true,"movie":{"type":"movie","id":1241983,"name":"Sonhos de Trem","image_path":"/iF1SxvdSNWkEfKlZnLzJbSsg4oT.jpg","director":"